.com/users/yamen-haddad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yamen-haddad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-10-23T17:47:08Z","updated_at":"2024-11-21T22:52:23Z","closed_at":"2024-11-21T22:52:14Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-13631](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13631)\r\n### Description\n\nAs Yugabyte codebase now uses Postgres 15, writing ysql migration scripts in pg15 has some differences to take into consideration the new pg_catalog schema as of pg version 15. One such pg_catalog table is `pg_proc`. For this table, the column `protransform` has been removed and a new row 'prosupport' has been added in pg 15.\r\n\r\n`yb_database_clones` is the first internal function we added after the new upgrade to pg 15. However, the ysql migration script didn't take that into consideration. This should be fixed.\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-13631]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13631?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"